works: The choice holds, and within a year {N} has a life that fits it.
works: Doors open along the road {N} chose, and {N} turns out to be ready for them.
fails: The plan falls apart within weeks, and {N} ends up back where {N} started, with less.
fails: {N} keeps wondering about the other road, and the doubt spoils the one taken.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- step 2, transform, calls WU (cycle s2)

== an apprenticeship that starts on Monday
tier: everyday
stages: young_adult
age: 17-20
calls: WU
threshold: young adult
step: 2
